8
00:00:20,041 --> 00:00:21,707
No Bazzite é quase pronto:

9
00:00:21,767 --> 00:00:25,291
a Tailscale já vem instalada, e o Sunshine
tem receita

10
00:00:25,351 --> 00:00:25,756
